WEBVTT

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.340
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.660
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:10.510
Today, it's Kairi and Musashi's big comeback!

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.470
Welcome back. Have you both been well?

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:16.180
Huh? Doesn't it look like they're sneaking around?

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.630
'Tis the movement of the samurai. 

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:19.720
'Tis, indeed. 

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:22.070
Ho hum, how hesitant.

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:24.130
And thus, our troubled tale begins!

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:25.470
Thus, indeed! 

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:26.580
Doki!

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.180
Yes! Yes!

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.100
Let's go!

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:37.110
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.900
Shugo, shugo! Yes!

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:48.600
Swing your arms! Hop, step, jump!

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:53.140
Now start marching straight ahead!

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:56.750
Way too awesome! Yes!

00:00:57.850 --> 00:01:00.270
Every dream I've ever had!

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:05.980
Since they're all actually coming true.

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:12.100
What kind of person will I be today?

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:17.390
What counts is being true to yourself!

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:21.540
Going somewhere?

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.960
Take it to the finish!

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:27.450
You'll always be able to

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:30.390
unlock your heart.

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:33.350
So keep on changing!

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:35.760
It's so exciting!

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:43.890
Let's go forward, believing in our hearts!

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:46.620
Straight ahead!

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:48.280
Yeah! Yeah!

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:03.640
Here.

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:05.940
The Nationwide Elementary School Student...

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:06.970
Summit?

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:11.700
Right, and I'd like you two to represent Seiyo Academy.

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:15.180
I'm not so sure I could handle a summit...

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:18.450
It sounds like they'll be discussing some complicated stuff.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:22.960
It's nothing so difficult. Think of it more like a field trip.

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:25.590
Oh wow, it's for two days and one night.

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:28.180
So we'll be staying overnight?!

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:29.970
It says here it's by a lake.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.830
I get to take a trip with Tadase-kun?!

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:39.440
Oh my, please stop, Tadase-kun!

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:40.850
Take <i>this!</i>

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:45.270
Look, that's Sirius.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.920
You're so smart, Tadase-kun.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:55.460
Earth to Hinamori-san...

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:56.990
Yes?

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:59.480
So... you'll attend?

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:00.680
Of course!

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:12.430
So you're on the Summit Committee?

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:15.520
Good luck, Chairman.

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:17.260
Thanks...

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:21.890
Seiyo Academy Elementary School Representatives
Hotori Tadase - 6th Grade
Hinamori Amu - 6th Grade

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:26.210
We'll finally get to see them again. 
This must please you immensely, Kairi.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:28.990
Hinamori-san is...

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:30.670
coming here?

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:36.210
Episode 71
The Arduous Path of Truth! Kairi Returns!

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:44.270
I'd like all students to 
line up over here, please!

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:48.680
After you put your luggage in your rooms, 
please assemble on the first floor!

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:51.600
Let's go!

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.920
This looks like it's going to be a blast!

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:55.760
Yeah!

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:59.730
I'm not sure about this... 
I don't know a single person here. 

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:02.960
Don't worry, we'll make friends in no time.

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:04.710
I'll see you a bit later, okay?

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:05.460
Okay. 

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:06.780
Chairman!

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:08.950
What's the matter?

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:10.930
Which room is mine again?

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.400
Oh, she meant her... 

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:14.470
Are you troubled?

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:19.150
I heard someone say "Chairman" and 
thought it might be Kairi, is all.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:24.250
Oh, I see. With all these students from different elementary schools, it wouldn't be strange to run into him here.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:28.180
Sanjo-kun, huh? I wonder how he's doing.

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:31.980
Sanjo Kairi-kun, also known as the Chairman!

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:36.340
He held the Jack's Chair before Nagihiko, 
and his Guardian Character is Musashi.

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:41.330
Even though he's younger, he's cool, 
smart, and someone you can count on.

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:48.070
He started out as a spy for Easter, but joined 
us in the fight against them in the end.  

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:52.470
But then he up and went back 
to his local elementary school!

00:04:53.070 --> 00:04:55.920
I love you, Hinamori Amu-san.

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:04.480
I love you now, and I always will, 
until the end of time.

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:13.750
One day, when I become a man worthy 
of you, I will definitely come back.

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:21.910
Amu-chan is blushing!

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:23.470
Am not!

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:26.290
Were you lost in a sweet reverie?

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:27.850
Give it a rest already!

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:30.550
Don't be bashful!

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.020
What is it?

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.940
Can't you feel a presence?

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:37.890
Presence?

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:45.730
Goodness gracious, what about your 
duties for the Summit Committee?

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:47.980
I'm getting them done. 

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:52.350
You're Saito-kun from 
Umesato Elementary, right?

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:55.680
Your room is at the middle 
of the hall right behind you.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:58.270
Thank you very much!

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:03.940
Ah, so you've memorized the 
names of all the participants.

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:06.640
Hinamori-san...

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:10.810
Kairi... If you wish to see her,
 quell your hesitation and go. 

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:14.660
I can't possibly show my face to them. 

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:20.270
I have no right to see Hinamori Amu-san 
the way I am now.

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:23.330
I knew it! It's Kairi and Musashi!

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:24.570
Amu-cha-

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:28.570
P-Please keep my presence here a secret!

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:30.630
It seems to be too late for that.

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:32.740
Loyal subjects!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:35.350
Kairi and Musashi are over here!

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:39.640
Kairi...

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:43.510
L-Long time no see...

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:55.520
This is awkward.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:58.480
Maybe they're nervous because it's been so long?

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:01.280
It is rather complicated... 

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:06.640
That settles it. Gather up, subjects!

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:13.610
Skulking around and spying on them... How could I have fallen so low?

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:19.890
I'm suddenly so self-conscious after remembering what he said to me... 

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:22.130
Oh, look at that.

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:24.230
This is green tea, isn't it?

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:30.970
You are it, Kiseki-dono!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.310
You'll never catch me, Mr. It!

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:34.520
Halt!

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:36.660
Do you truly think you can elude your King?!

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:38.850
Halt!

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:42.850
Beseech all you like, I'll do nothing of the sort!

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.180
You troublemakers...

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:49.310
Wait, Kiseki!

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:50.680
Stop fooling around!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:05.140
The ice has been broken at last.

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:07.010
Those two are high-maintenance.

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:11.930
Oh, you became President 
of the Student Council?

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:14.430
Isn't that quite the 
accomplishment for a fourth-grader?

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:18.990
I guess so, and they did say that I'm the youngest president in the school's history. 

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:20.840
That's incredible, Kairi!

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:22.930
It's nothing, really.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:28.120
If you're wearing that armband, does that mean 
you're also part of the Summit Committee? 

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:28.900
Yes.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:32.220
You always have been reliable, Kairi! 

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:36.100
Please! You flatter me! 

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:37.350
Too bright!

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:42.480
Oh, Kairi... You've never been able to prevent your overflowing pride from shining through. 

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:44.140
Really? Even with his glasses? 

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:55.530
There's no reason to cry. 

00:08:57.490 --> 00:09:00.620
Pick it up, and we'll get 
something to wipe up the mess.

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:01.770
Okay.

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:15.520
We'll now begin the summit. 
I hope you all enjoy it. 

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:19.760
Let's all get to know one another 
as we play many fun games. 

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:30.790
Kairi's working so hard. 

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:32.680
I must learn from him.

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:34.390
This is gonna be fun! 

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:36.500
I can't wait!

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.170
Everyone, please listen!

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:42.520
Quiet down!

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.100
What should we do?

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.540
We can't start the games like this.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.980
They seem to be having problems.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:53.070
Yeah, bummer...

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.310
Nikaidou-sensei?

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:02.450
Somehow, we have to get them to 
pay attention to Sanjo-kun.

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:27.720
Ran, turn right!

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:29.750
Roger that!

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:32.540
I shall captivate the hearts of the masses!

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:36.060
That's wonderful, but please steer!

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:40.050
Here we come, Kairi!

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:41.940
Catch us!

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:50.080
That committee member is cool! 

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:51.890
Was that magic? Neat!

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:57.930
Those simpletons fancy themselves geniuses, do they?

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:15.840
I wasn't sure how it'd go at first, 
but it's great that everything worked out. 

00:11:17.090 --> 00:11:21.520
Yes, and it's all thanks to your and 
the King's quick wits, Hinamori-san.

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:26.200
Not really. You actually settled them all down, Kairi.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.270
That's right.

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:34.650
H-Hey, let's all go down to the lake tomorrow.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:40.020
Yes! We have free time all day, so committee 
members don't have to work, right?

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:41.310
Right.

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:43.720
That settles that. Agreed?

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:50.810
I'm... going to get a drink.

00:11:57.920 --> 00:11:59.820
Why are you so downcast?

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.300
My skills are lacking in so many areas...

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:05.830
A small token of praise, and I am immediately exhilarated. 

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:07.580
You needn't brood over it.

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:12.800
What's wrong with Kairi? He seems down.

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:13.390
Yeah.

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:16.400
Is being on the committee really hard?

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.930
That's quite the atmosphere they've got going there.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.890
We shouldn't bother them.

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:24.210
They're a perfect match, don't you think?

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:25.320
Aren't they?

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:28.060
And we can ride the boats, too.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:28.670
Sure.

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:31.890
Okay, and this time around 
I'm gonna row as best I can!

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:36.860
Hinamori-san, would you 
wait here a moment?

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:38.020
Sure.

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:44.810
So you intend to go back to 
your room without telling them?

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:45.830
It's fine.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:47.630
Wait, Sanjo-kun.

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:50.850
Kairi!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:54.050
He thinks he can just 
pretend he didn't hear us?

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:55.020
Unacceptable!

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:58.770
Halt, former Jack!

00:13:00.620 --> 00:13:02.650
I thirst.

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:04.560
Provide your King with a beverage. 

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:07.630
Please accept this, my King.

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:08.830
Kairi...

00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:13.920
It seems your body does not easily 
shed the role it had so ingrained.

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:18.090
S-Sorry.

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:19.310
Don't worry about it.

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:24.280
Where did they go off to?

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.140
I don't want...

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:28.800
to see Hinamori-san anymore.

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:34.220
My insufficiencies give me 
no right to be with her. 

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:36.920
You shouldn't think like that.

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:39.800
No, I must further devote myself.

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:45.140
Until all doubts that I am earnestly following the 
path of truth are gone, I shall not see her.

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:46.560
But...

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:54.020
Hinamori-san.

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:56.440
And yet, he meets her again immediately.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:59.190
Please don't rub it in.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:03.180
Why? Why won't you see me?

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:05.580
Because I lack-

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:06.400
What does that matter?!

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:10.520
I want to ascertain the path of truth!

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:14.770
Fine! But tell me, how exactly do you plan to do that?

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:18.720
I think it's admirable that you're trying to become who you want to be and all,

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:21.850
but I don't understand why that means we can't see each other until you do!

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:24.580
What's wrong with the way you are <i>right now?</i>

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:30.890
Please... just leave me alone.

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:42.890
I'm going to the forest with everyone!

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:46.570
We're gonna see squirrels and rabbits!

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:49.220
Sanjo-san, are you going anywhere?

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:54.570
I'm...

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.530
Kairi's not coming?

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:02.770
No...

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:07.470
And the sun has gone away, too.

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:10.050
We have a problem!

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:12.770
Looks like something's up.

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.040
We have to tell someone on the committee!

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:28.180
Are you sure about this? 
They are waiting for you at the lake.

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:34.240
Goodness, at least relax your shoulders a bit.

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:37.900
I <i>will</i> throw away this hesitation.

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:41.610
Why won't you see me?

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:46.230
I'll become a man more worthy of you.

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:49.970
And for that goal, I will ascertain the path of truth!

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:54.970
Fine! But tell me, how exactly do you plan to do that?

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:58.300
I don't know... but...

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:05.970
But I cannot show my pathetic 
self in your presence anymore!

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:10.140
What's wrong with the way you are <i>right now?</i>

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:19.970
The way I am... right now?

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:22.550
Kairi.

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:26.520
Devotion to one's ideals is essential, indeed. 

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:34.250
However, to that end, is it not necessary to first accept yourself exactly as you are?

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:47.020
A samurai would not be ashamed of what he lacks. 

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:52.620
Rather, he would follow his heart, 
knowing that he might meet Hinamori-san. 

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:55.010
Well said!

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:56.960
We go to the lake!

00:16:58.110 --> 00:17:02.620
Sanjo-kun, we have a problem! A boy named 
Saito-kun was separated from us in the forest!

00:17:04.820 --> 00:17:08.170
The Seiyo Academy reps went to search for him, but...

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:12.140
Musashi, Character Change!

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:13.160
Right!

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:23.420
Wait, wait!

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:29.180
Aww, it got away.

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:33.060
Huh?

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:40.600
Saito-kun!

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:42.500
If you're there, answer me!

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:43.950
Amu-chan, wait!

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:46.560
Su's gathering information!

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:47.680
Gathering information?

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:50.390
Yes, that's right, a boy.

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:53.340
Have you seen him?

00:17:57.450 --> 00:17:59.770
We have to find him 
before the weather turns!

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:03.930
A deer?

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:10.410
It seems that Saito-kun chased after a 
rabbit and went deeper into the forest.

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:12.890
Amu-chan is heading there already.

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:17.060
She said it was this way!

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:21.480
Saito-kun!

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:30.100
Saito-kun! Wait right there, I'm coming! 

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.280
Tadase-kun!

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:43.860
Are you okay, Hinamori-san?

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:47.210
I was so scared!

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:48.890
It's all right now.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.430
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:53.220
No.

00:18:58.090 --> 00:18:59.340
Amu-chan...

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:00.770
Let's hurry back.

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:01.930
Yeah.

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:47.180
Kairi!

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.950
I'm glad I made it in time.

00:19:58.080 --> 00:19:59.870
Let's go, Sanjo-kun!

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:00.890
Yes, King!

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:02.330
Me, too!

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:03.190
No.

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:08.060
Just leave this to us!

00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:10.240
My heart:

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:11.720
My heart:

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.560
Unlock!

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:26.560
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:31.420
Character Transformation: Samurai Soul!

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:40.390
Holy Crown Special!

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:43.350
Thunder Blade!

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:09.180
So cool!

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:17.650
For real! They were seriously cool!

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:21.530
Yes, of course. Just try not to wander off in 
the mountains by yourself anymore, okay?

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:22.300
Okay!

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:27.710
Forgive me. 

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:31.810
W-What are you apologizing for? 
You just saved me.

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:36.890
Because I was wrong to say that I wouldn't see 
you until I became a man worthy of you.

00:21:38.550 --> 00:21:44.060
From now on, I'll be less uptight. If I feel 
like seeing you, I'll just go to see you.

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:48.560
R-Right! That's what it means to be friends, yeah!

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:53.800
Amu-chan, what're you so embarrassed about?

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:54.560
Zip it!

00:21:56.770 --> 00:22:01.360
King, just because you're never far away, doesn't mean you should lower your guard.

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:05.120
What? What did you just say?

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:08.090
It's just a guy thing. Right, King?

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:09.720
Right...

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:13.490
No fair, tell me! I wanna know!

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:14.640
It's a secret.

00:22:14.640 --> 00:22:17.000
Come on, Kairi!

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:26.350
We'll walk this path,

00:22:26.350 --> 00:22:30.140
no matter what may happen.

00:22:30.470 --> 00:22:34.430
Because when we combine our strength,

00:22:34.430 --> 00:22:38.350
something's bound to change!

00:22:46.220 --> 00:22:53.660
You're always so quick to say "absolutely,"

00:22:54.170 --> 00:22:58.030
but shouldn't you think it through a bit first?

00:22:58.400 --> 00:23:01.410
Can't you at least do that???

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:06.160
You know, I'm starting to understand

00:23:06.160 --> 00:23:09.620
the delicate movements of the heart.

00:23:10.060 --> 00:23:17.080
My own abilities aren't really all that special...

00:23:18.390 --> 00:23:22.380
But even if the first shot's off the mark

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:26.250
the third'll bravely hit the bull's-eye!

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:32.340
We'll walk this path,

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:35.960
even if it's a steep climb.

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:40.430
Because when we put our hearts together

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:44.380
something definitely changes!

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:52.350
And now, Su's Urban Legend Corner!

00:23:52.350 --> 00:23:53.410
Wait, what?

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:58.750
Some say that Lulu's grandmother strikes 
terror in the very hearts of her parents!

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:00.050
Her grandmother does?

00:24:00.050 --> 00:24:01.710
Eek! Scary!

00:24:01.710 --> 00:24:03.830
What's so scary about Lulu's grandmother?

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:05.160
That is... 

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:07.030
Something you can look forward to in the next episode!

00:24:07.030 --> 00:24:09.010
Eek! Scary!

00:24:09.470 --> 00:24:11.800
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:13.690
All Shook Up! The Grandmother Appears!!

00:24:13.690 --> 00:24:17.460
Please stayed tuned for the next 
"Su's Urban Legend Corner" as well!

00:24:17.460 --> 00:24:19.180
There won't be one!
